OPK Development

  This is a website where I present several Open Source projects:
  
  [{{{./embedded-glassfish-web-plugin/}Embedded Glassfish Web Plugin}}] A Maven plugin that allows you to create an
  {{{./instant_developer_experience.html}Instant Developer Experience}}, by running your web application in an embedded
  GlassFish container.

  [{{{./jdbc-populator/}JDBC Populator}}] A Web Fragment that simulates the Hibernate feature of importing a resource
  named <<<import.sql>>> into a database.


  [{{{./opk-parent.html}Parent POM}}] Parent POM for all projects.

